		"description": {
			"public": "<p><strong>Damage:</strong> 1d6+STR Piercing or Radiant</p><p><strong>Properties:</strong> Range 8</p><hr><p><em>Javelin of Light (Champion of the Bringer, level 3): Free Action. Create a javelin of light that deals Piercing or Radiant damage. It disappears at the end of your turn. These javelins' die increase 1 step at levels 7, 11 and 15.</em></p><hr><p><em>[A] Created by using the Javelin of Light feature, which asks Piercing or Radiant and sets the die for your level (d6, d8 from level 7, d10 from 11, d12 from 15). It vanishes at the end of your turn, or when combat ends. The Javelin weapon mastery applies to it.</em></p><p><em>[M] It takes no inventory slot. Dragged onto a sheet by hand it keeps this 1d6 radiant copy until deleted.</em></p>",
